  <ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock id="f-6" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;6. See Entergy Texas's 2026 FERC Form 3Q For the Quarterly Period Ended June 30, 2026 Notes to Financial Statements, Note 4.&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfObligationsIncurredOrAssumedByRespondentAsGuarantorForThePerformanceByAnotherOfAnyAgreementOrObligationTextBlock>
